---
interface Props { image: string; image2: string }
const { image, image2 } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="story" class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 sm:py-32" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(255,90,31,.14),transparent_55%)]"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="relative order-2 lg:order-1">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        <figure class="reveal-clip col-span-3 aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-coal-800">
          <img src={image} alt="Warm lighting and interior design at Grand BBQ" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="parallax h-full w-full object-cover" />
        </figure>
        <figure class="reveal-clip col-span-2 mt-16 aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-coal-800" style="--d:200ms">
          <img src={image2} alt="Dining atmosphere at Grand BBQ" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="parallax h-full w-full object-cover" />
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal glass absolute -bottom-6 left-6 right-6 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:left-auto sm:right-10 sm:w-72" style="--d:400ms">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-flame-300">Hand-crafted</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ash-200">Every dish made exclusively by Iraqi hands — <span class="font-arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">بايادي عراقية حصراً</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
      <p class="reveal text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-flame-400">— By Chef Murad</p>
      <h2 id="story-title" class="reveal mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.9]" style="--d:100ms">
        The experience starts <span class="text-fire">before</span> the first bite.
      </h2>

      <blockquote class="reveal mt-8 border-r-2 border-ember-500 pr-5 text-right" style="--d:200ms">
        <p class="font-arabic text-2xl leading-relaxed text-ash-100" lang="ar" dir="rtl">
          لأن التجربة ما تبدأ مع أول لقمة… تبدأ من أول خطوة تدخل بيها
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <p class="reveal mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash-300" style="--d:300ms">
        “A place you relax in — and come back to, not once, but every time.” From the lighting to the décor, every
        detail at Grand BBQ is designed so each visit has its own character. Chef Murad pairs that atmosphere with a
        menu that bridges Basra’s love of the grill with American-style smokehouse craft and Italian comfort.
      </p>

      <ul class="reveal mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3" style="--d:400ms">
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>
          <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Real smoke</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ash-400">Slow, patient cooking</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🕯️</span>
          <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Crafted space</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ash-400">Lighting &amp; décor</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">👨‍👩‍👧</span>
          <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">For everyone</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-ash-400">Friends &amp; family</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>